WEBVTT

00:08.690 --> 00:12.490
Morihito, do you remember Nico?

00:13.990 --> 00:15.410
The witch Nico?

00:15.950 --> 00:19.910
...we decided you and Nico
will live here together.

00:20.540 --> 00:22.000
<i>Live...</i>

00:23.710 --> 00:24.960
<i>with Nico?</i>

00:34.090 --> 00:36.390
I hope Moi's been doing well.

00:48.770 --> 00:49.690
What the...

00:54.570 --> 00:55.780
Hi, Moi.

02:26.580 --> 02:31.380
A GIANT ROOKIE

02:35.340 --> 02:37.380
Good morning, Moi.

02:37.760 --> 02:40.380
Our first morning, living together.

02:40.890 --> 02:42.640
It's kind of awkward, isn't it?

02:44.180 --> 02:45.560
I mean, not really.

02:47.060 --> 02:49.890
You should probably come downstairs
after you've changed out of your pajamas.

02:50.480 --> 02:53.270
We may be childhood friends,
but we're still a guy and a girl.

02:54.400 --> 02:56.190
WITCH GIRL IN LOVE
NICO

02:54.400 --> 02:56.190
WHAT IS MOI'S IMPRESSION?

02:57.150 --> 03:00.150
It's like, there could be
some romantic tension there, maybe?

03:00.150 --> 03:03.160
I can sense that
he sees me as a woman,

03:03.160 --> 03:06.490
and maybe that can't be helped
because he's a guy.

03:06.620 --> 03:09.960
Well, I'm prepared for anything.

03:10.080 --> 03:12.170
We're living under one roof after all.

03:12.170 --> 03:15.590
Maybe something will happen,
maybe it won't.

03:15.710 --> 03:17.840
Oh geez, oh no!

03:18.800 --> 03:20.880
I think something might happen.

03:30.230 --> 03:33.060
ENTRANCE CEREMONY

03:33.270 --> 03:35.810
It's finally here. It's going to begin!

03:35.980 --> 03:38.570
My romantic adolescence
will begin from here!

03:41.280 --> 03:43.320
Right there. Look, Moi!

03:43.450 --> 03:47.580
We're in the same class.
It's the ever-delightful Class 3. Yay!

03:48.790 --> 03:52.290
I'm so excited. I'm a witch,
but I hope I can make friends.

03:52.290 --> 03:56.130
<i>This is bad.
Nico's emotions are really high.</i>

03:52.290 --> 03:57.340
Sun, sun, sun!
It's the warm light of the sun.

04:07.680 --> 04:13.770
All right, here we go. I can only sense
fun things for my high school life.

04:18.730 --> 04:22.570
Oh wow, everyone looks so grown up.

04:22.570 --> 04:26.450
And then there's people in relationships,
like boyfriends and girlfriends, and...

04:27.870 --> 04:28.870
Peek.

04:33.580 --> 04:34.330
Nico.

04:37.500 --> 04:38.290
Yes?

04:39.500 --> 04:40.380
We gotta talk.

04:40.380 --> 04:43.130
<i>Is this a confession of love?</i>

04:44.050 --> 04:47.220
S-So, what did you want to...

04:47.390 --> 04:52.310
When we introduce ourselves in class,
don't you dare say that you're a witch.

04:52.310 --> 04:52.980
What?

04:53.310 --> 04:57.150
And don't use any magic
at school, got that?

04:59.610 --> 05:01.230
GRADE 1 CLASS 3

05:01.610 --> 05:04.400
My name is Yuri Makuwa,
and I will be your homeroom teacher.

05:04.400 --> 05:05.990
Let's get along this year.

05:05.990 --> 05:07.570
Yes, we got a pretty teacher.

05:07.570 --> 05:09.030
Class 3 for the win.

05:10.370 --> 05:12.580
And my hobbies are ma...

05:12.700 --> 05:18.750
URON MIRAGE

05:12.910 --> 05:14.540
<i>Manga. I love reading manga.</i>

05:14.540 --> 05:16.920
<i>I'm a super-otaku who even buys up
all the fanfiction.</i>

05:16.920 --> 05:18.750
<i>But if I say that, I'll sound really cringy.</i>

05:18.750 --> 05:21.800
<i>You can't, Yuri.
You have to come off as a cool teacher.</i>

05:21.800 --> 05:24.220
My hobbies are dancing the mambo.

05:24.760 --> 05:26.550
This teacher is kinda strange.

05:27.050 --> 05:29.850
Okay, I'm going to randomly call names
from the roster,

05:29.850 --> 05:31.970
so when you hear yours,
please introduce yourself.

05:32.930 --> 05:35.890
Like I said before,
don't introduce yourself as a witch.

05:36.390 --> 05:37.940
All right.

05:38.230 --> 05:42.020
<i>But I want to help as many people
as I can with my magic.</i>

05:42.270 --> 05:45.690
<i>I'm sure she's reluctant
to hide her identity,</i>

05:46.030 --> 05:48.280
<i>but saying that you're a witch
would stand out in a bad way.</i>

05:48.660 --> 05:53.040
<i>There's a prophecy that within a year,
disaster will befall onto Nico.</i>

05:53.700 --> 05:58.710
<i>It's my job as her familiar to make sure
she has a peaceful high school life.</i>

05:59.000 --> 06:00.330
<i>Forgive me, Nico.</i>

06:00.330 --> 06:02.920
Okay, let's start with the boys. Hara.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.670
I'm Kowashi Hara.
My stomach really hurts a lot.

06:06.090 --> 06:07.340
I'm Ishi Tsuyoshi.

06:07.340 --> 06:10.300
I have a strong will, and I've been
going sleeveless since the second grade!

06:10.590 --> 06:12.640
Hey there, I'm Takashi Isshiki.

06:12.640 --> 06:15.100
I want to be as interesting as possible,
so I always make enemies.

06:15.100 --> 06:17.940
And someone's already flaming
my comment section.

06:18.230 --> 06:22.020
I'm Arashi Komeran. I love leaving long,
flaming comments in the comment section.

06:22.020 --> 06:22.940
You bastard!

06:23.520 --> 06:25.440
All right, settle down everyone.

06:24.440 --> 06:25.940
ARASHI KOMERAN
LEAVES FLAMING COMMENTS

06:25.440 --> 06:28.610
Let's go over to the girls. Ureshino.

06:26.320 --> 06:29.200
<i>Moi's taking notes on our classmates.</i>

06:28.610 --> 06:33.080
Yes. Hello, I'm Kukumi Ureshino.
My hobbies are reading books and manga.

06:29.360 --> 06:34.160
<i>He's as detail-oriented as a bean counter,
which is a funny trait to have for an ogre!</i>

06:33.080 --> 06:35.660
My favorite series right now
is Uron Mirage.

06:34.160 --> 06:35.660
KUKUMI URESHINO
HOBBIES ARE MAMBO

06:36.540 --> 06:39.420
<i>Oh, he wrote something wrong, so cute.</i>

06:40.710 --> 06:44.670
<i>There it is! The eraser attached
to the mechanical pencil.</i>

06:44.670 --> 06:47.670
<i>Oh, but those are so hard to use, right?</i>

06:47.800 --> 06:48.880
<i>Oh no, it came off.</i>

06:49.430 --> 06:50.970
<i>In a matter of seconds, too!</i>

06:50.970 --> 06:52.640
<i>You have to be careful.</i>

06:52.760 --> 06:55.100
<i>But there's still a little left on the pencil.</i>

06:55.260 --> 06:56.640
<i>What ever will you do?</i>

06:56.810 --> 06:59.140
<i>It's like a half-eaten Caplico.</i>

06:59.140 --> 07:02.400
<i>Oh geez, he looks so dejected!</i>

07:02.690 --> 07:08.280
<i>I didn't want to watch an ogre look so sad
over his eraser popping off like that.</i>

07:08.940 --> 07:11.990
<i>Ah-ha! But what if
I use a spell that makes things bigger?</i>

07:11.990 --> 07:14.780
<i>I can cast that on his eraser
so he'll have more to use.</i>

07:14.780 --> 07:16.910
GROW

07:15.780 --> 07:16.910
It got bigger!

07:17.200 --> 07:19.870
Stranger things have happened in this world.

07:19.870 --> 07:21.670
Nico, did you do this?

07:21.830 --> 07:24.670
So? How does it feel to be saved by magic?

07:24.880 --> 07:27.670
I was wrong all along!
You can use magic as much as you want.

07:27.670 --> 07:30.550
Hurray for magic! And I also love you!

07:31.590 --> 07:34.890
<i>This is it! I'll call it
the Giant Caplico Strategy.</i>

07:34.890 --> 07:38.680
<i>To give an explanation, the spell Embiggen
makes the targeted item larger.</i>

07:39.020 --> 07:41.980
<i>If you use your hand,
the whole item will get larger.</i>

07:40.430 --> 07:41.980
GROW

07:42.440 --> 07:46.770
<i>If you use your finger and point at the item,
you can make a part of the item larger.</i>

07:44.060 --> 07:46.770
GROW

07:48.320 --> 07:50.150
<i>Embiggen!</i>

07:54.530 --> 07:56.080
<i>He turned into adult Gon!</i>

07:56.280 --> 07:57.830
<i>I totally missed!</i>

07:57.830 --> 08:00.580
<i>But he hasn't even noticed!
What's going on with his hair?</i>

08:00.750 --> 08:03.580
Okay, next, Magami... Huh?

08:03.710 --> 08:05.290
I'm Keigo Magami.

08:05.290 --> 08:06.710
My hobbies are collecting LPs...

08:06.710 --> 08:09.050
<i>Did Gon Freecss enroll in our school?</i>

08:09.670 --> 08:14.090
<i>Did he use both his vows and his limitations
to force himself to age up?</i>

08:14.430 --> 08:16.930
<i>At this point, he must be thinking
that it's okay to end it.</i>

08:16.930 --> 08:20.350
<i>How I handle this
is a big test of my teaching abilities.</i>

08:20.680 --> 08:22.100
<i>Wait, that's not even possible.</i>

08:22.100 --> 08:25.100
<i>That's an illusion, right? And honestly
my favorite is Kurapika anyway.</i>

08:25.100 --> 08:27.520
<i>Oh no, I have to dispel it quickly.</i>

08:27.520 --> 08:29.400
<i>In order to dispel Embiggen,</i>

08:29.400 --> 08:32.860
<i>you must cast the same spell
on exactly the same spot as before.</i>

08:32.860 --> 08:34.570
<i>Embiggen!</i>

08:36.490 --> 08:39.120
<i>Crap! So huge! I missed again!</i>

08:39.450 --> 08:43.210
<i>Moi still hasn't noticed anything?
But that's kind of cute.</i>

08:43.210 --> 08:44.120
Koboke.

08:44.290 --> 08:48.130
Hello, I'm Suberu Koboke
It's been a while, right everyone?

08:48.130 --> 08:49.750
No wait, we all just met!

08:53.220 --> 08:55.260
<i>His face really brightens up
when he laughs.</i>

08:55.430 --> 08:57.470
And next is...

08:59.430 --> 09:01.520
Huh? What's wrong, Ms. Makuwa?

09:01.520 --> 09:03.600
Oh, um, uhh...

09:04.100 --> 09:05.690
<i>This definitely has to be an illusion!</i>

09:05.690 --> 09:08.610
<i>It's because I stayed up way too late
last night reading a comedy manga.</i>

09:08.980 --> 09:11.230
<i>Oh crap, I really have to be
on target this time!</i>

09:12.570 --> 09:13.990
<i>I missed!</i>

09:15.610 --> 09:16.780
Huh? Who's that?

09:16.780 --> 09:17.740
What's going on?

09:18.740 --> 09:22.700
<i>What? Why is my hand so huge?
It's just my left arm?</i>

09:22.830 --> 09:24.870
<i>Th-This can only be from...</i>

09:26.580 --> 09:29.210
<i>I knew it was you!
What did you do to me?</i>

09:29.670 --> 09:32.000
<i>Don't you dare look at me like,
"Woops, sowwy!"</i>

09:32.130 --> 09:34.220
<i>My left arm is massive now, thanks!</i>

09:34.220 --> 09:35.800
Next, Otogi.

09:37.380 --> 09:38.140
Yes.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.390
Huh? What's going on?

09:39.390 --> 09:41.010
Is he twitching?

09:41.010 --> 09:41.890
Is he hurt?

09:42.220 --> 09:44.730
<i>Dang it.
This might turn into a scene.</i>

09:47.020 --> 09:49.940
M-My left arm... It stirs...

09:49.940 --> 09:51.150
Is he delusional?

09:51.400 --> 09:54.740
Morihito Otogi.
I'm from Magani Middle School.

09:55.240 --> 09:56.950
I won't join any clubs,

09:56.950 --> 10:00.280
and that's because I'm in the middle
of a mission that I can't talk about.

10:00.280 --> 10:02.660
- He's got it bad.
- Yep, he's gone off the deep end.

10:03.830 --> 10:06.710
<i>They're starting to think that I'm some
weird delusional kid in an anime.</i>

10:07.120 --> 10:09.670
<i>But I have to keep up
the charade now!</i>

10:09.830 --> 10:12.170
Hey! Calm down, Leftios.

10:12.340 --> 10:13.300
Leftios?

10:13.300 --> 10:14.800
Is he pretending to be possessed
by a monster?

10:14.800 --> 10:16.970
Shh, that's what his story setting is.

10:16.970 --> 10:20.010
<i>My high school life is over.</i>

10:20.010 --> 10:21.050
Leftios?

10:21.050 --> 10:23.680
Whose fault do you think this is?
Hurry and reverse the spell!

10:23.890 --> 10:26.980
W-Well, it's nice to have a student
with unique characteristics.

10:26.980 --> 10:29.400
Okay, next is Minami.

10:29.560 --> 10:31.730
What's up, I'm Kara Minami.

10:30.190 --> 10:31.270
Moi.

10:31.730 --> 10:37.530
I love getting rowdy with my friends
in places like diners and karaoke.

10:32.190 --> 10:33.520
Give me your arm.

10:33.520 --> 10:34.940
Hurry up!

10:35.150 --> 10:38.950
<i>His hand is huge.
Well, at least I won't miss with this size.</i>

10:37.530 --> 10:38.950
And yeah, that's me.

10:39.070 --> 10:42.070
<i>Sorry, Moi. Embiggen.</i>

10:42.070 --> 10:43.700
Next is Wakatsuki.

10:43.700 --> 10:44.580
Y-Yes!

10:44.990 --> 10:47.120
<i>Oopsie. I cast it on myself.</i>

10:52.500 --> 10:53.290
What the...

10:53.290 --> 10:54.090
A titan?

10:56.590 --> 10:57.800
Um...

10:58.260 --> 10:59.800
I'm Nico Wakatsuki.

11:00.590 --> 11:01.840
I'm a witch.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.430
Our cover was blown on the first day.

11:04.050 --> 11:08.980
AFTERWARDS, THEY MADE UP

11:05.180 --> 11:08.980
EPISODE 01 EPILOGUE

11:05.180 --> 11:08.980
"SORRY I PUNCHED YOU SO MUCH."
"SORRY I MADE YOU BALD.
IT LOOKS GOOD ON YOU."

11:10.440 --> 11:13.980
EPISODE 01 EPILOGUE

11:10.440 --> 11:13.980
WHEN HE WAS ABOUT TO EMOTIONALLY VOMIT
ONTO A DARK BLOG THAT HE JUST MADE,
THE SPELL WORE OFF.
WHAT WAS I DOING...

11:10.440 --> 11:13.980
MOI'S ALWAYS LOOKING
AT HIS COMPUTER
AND NEVER AT ME.
BOO.

11:16.570 --> 11:17.820
GRADE 1 CLASS 3

11:17.150 --> 11:23.320
So, we've already received a proper notification
from Nico's mother that she's a witch.

11:18.320 --> 11:22.870
LET'S GO TO A DINER!

11:23.740 --> 11:27.330
She'll be attending this school
whilst she completes her training as a witch.

11:31.120 --> 11:34.590
<i>I wanted Nico to at least
make one friend.</i>

11:35.710 --> 11:38.670
<i>But after seeing that, I don't think
anyone would want to talk to her.</i>

11:38.880 --> 11:39.590
<i>Well...</i>

11:40.220 --> 11:42.930
<i>I don't think anyone knows
how to be around a witch, anyway.</i>

11:44.390 --> 11:46.470
Okay, that's it for today.

11:46.560 --> 11:48.390
Everyone stand, and bow.

11:51.560 --> 11:53.150
Nico, let's go home.

11:53.230 --> 11:54.190
Okay.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.940
Hey, Wakatsuki.

11:59.240 --> 12:02.700
Kara Minami and Kukumi Ureshino.

12:02.820 --> 12:04.990
Wanna go to a diner on the way home?

12:06.490 --> 12:07.740
Moi.

12:09.200 --> 12:09.870
Go ahead.

12:11.790 --> 12:12.670
Thanks!

12:17.750 --> 12:19.800
Hey, what's up?

12:20.260 --> 12:23.340
All three of you are lookin' real pretty.

12:23.340 --> 12:26.140
How bout it?
Wanna go karaoke with us?

12:27.850 --> 12:29.060
Let's go inside.

12:30.020 --> 12:31.600
Hey, hold on now.

12:32.350 --> 12:35.860
Listen, we don't even wanna spare
a second for you losers, got that?

12:36.730 --> 12:37.610
Losers?

12:37.820 --> 12:38.610
Get lost.

12:44.610 --> 12:47.830
That was so amazing, Kara!

12:47.990 --> 12:50.870
Shucks, forget about me.

12:50.870 --> 12:53.370
Instead, I wanna hear about you, Nico.

12:53.580 --> 12:58.250
It's so surprising that you're a witch.
Can you cast different kinds of spells?

12:58.250 --> 13:00.550
Yep, I sure can. Tons of them!

13:00.550 --> 13:03.380
I'm great at it! I can do anything.

13:03.380 --> 13:05.890
That confidence smells dangerous.

13:06.050 --> 13:07.760
This is pretty fun.

13:08.350 --> 13:11.720
Where I lived, growing up
was kind of different.

13:11.970 --> 13:15.730
I didn't really have
that many friends who were my age.

13:15.900 --> 13:20.900
So I've always wanted to hang out
with friends like this after school.

13:23.320 --> 13:25.700
Did you and Kara
go to the same middle school?

13:25.700 --> 13:26.740
That's right.

13:27.820 --> 13:31.990
I also didn't have too many friends
in middle school either.

13:32.540 --> 13:36.500
I was really shy, so I read a lot of books.

13:33.410 --> 13:36.500
- She's kind of weird, isn't she?
- How pathetic.

13:37.210 --> 13:38.130
However...

13:40.040 --> 13:42.460
Hey, wanna go hang out at a diner?

13:45.090 --> 13:46.300
Yes.

13:46.470 --> 13:48.510
Kara started talking to me.

13:48.760 --> 13:50.050
That's so awesome!

13:50.050 --> 13:52.100
Come on, that was a while ago.

13:52.470 --> 13:56.440
Anyway, Nico!
Who's that hottie you're with?

13:56.600 --> 13:59.060
You mean Moi?
He's my childhood friend.

13:59.060 --> 14:01.320
There it is! The childhood friend!

14:01.320 --> 14:02.570
But you don't have to be so...

14:02.570 --> 14:03.230
Moi.

14:03.610 --> 14:04.070
Yeah.

14:04.400 --> 14:06.240
I can really go? Thanks!

14:06.360 --> 14:07.360
Yeah, go ahead.

14:07.450 --> 14:09.240
I promise I'll make this up to you.

14:09.410 --> 14:10.370
Don't worry about it.

14:10.950 --> 14:12.370
You guys are like practically dating!

14:12.580 --> 14:14.540
W-We're not dating.

14:14.540 --> 14:18.620
Then why are you two going home together
while just being friends? Isn't that weird?

14:19.120 --> 14:21.670
That's because we live together.

14:23.090 --> 14:24.210
Calm down, Kara.

14:24.210 --> 14:27.260
What? What's happening?
Living together? Indecent? Impure?

14:27.380 --> 14:30.010
I-It's not impure, it's innocent!

14:30.340 --> 14:31.760
That's not innocent at all!

14:31.760 --> 14:33.930
How dare they ignore us.

14:33.930 --> 14:35.310
Those crazies!

14:35.310 --> 14:37.770
We'll round them up
and do unspeakable things to them.

14:38.020 --> 14:41.230
So, what kind of person
is this childhood friend?

14:41.230 --> 14:42.020
What?

14:42.020 --> 14:43.730
I also want to know.

14:43.980 --> 14:46.030
I mean, you're not dating, right?

14:46.030 --> 14:47.990
If he's a cool guy,
can you introduce us?

14:48.110 --> 14:49.910
I'd like to get a boyfriend.

14:51.280 --> 14:53.240
Let's see...

15:01.460 --> 15:03.170
Who the hell...

15:04.590 --> 15:07.300
You can't rely on him at all.

15:08.340 --> 15:09.180
You're dead!

15:10.050 --> 15:11.300
He's weak when it comes to fights.

15:13.390 --> 15:14.970
He's selfish...

15:16.470 --> 15:18.390
and he's way too pushy.

15:18.560 --> 15:20.480
Basically, he can't take a hint.

15:20.480 --> 15:24.020
She finally made some new friends,
so don't get in the way.

15:24.230 --> 15:26.860
Yeah. He's really not that cool.

15:28.860 --> 15:31.240
Well, I guess that's just how reality is, huh?

15:31.240 --> 15:35.200
It'll be too good to be true if your
childhood friend you're living with is a great guy.

15:35.200 --> 15:36.870
So his face is the only good part?

15:36.870 --> 15:39.790
Nico, be careful that
you don't get attacked.

15:40.830 --> 15:41.830
Yeah.

15:43.330 --> 15:45.250
<i>I'm really sorry, Moi.</i>

15:45.880 --> 15:47.920
Man, girls are harsh.

15:49.720 --> 15:51.180
Morning, Nico.

15:51.680 --> 15:54.050
Man, witches are so amazing.

15:51.680 --> 15:56.010
THE FLYING CLASSROOM

15:54.260 --> 15:55.600
Yeah, I was shocked!

15:55.600 --> 15:57.060
Can you fly on brooms and stuff?

15:57.060 --> 15:58.810
Can I have your LINE I.D?

15:59.980 --> 16:02.310
<i>I was worried about what would happen,</i>

16:02.810 --> 16:04.810
<i>but it's fine if she ends up making friends.</i>

16:05.650 --> 16:06.570
<i>However...</i>

16:06.770 --> 16:09.360
You're childhood friends
with the witch, right?

16:09.360 --> 16:11.530
Can you ask her to turn me into a chair?

16:11.530 --> 16:13.530
I wanna shoot a Kamehame-ha!

16:13.610 --> 16:15.910
<i>Why are all the weirdos
gathering around me?</i>

16:16.030 --> 16:18.910
Hey, Nico. Can you show everyone
your magic?

16:18.910 --> 16:19.660
<i>There it is!</i>

16:19.870 --> 16:24.290
<i>Magic isn't for show, you know.
You're just asking for trouble.</i>

16:24.460 --> 16:25.670
Yeah, we wanna see.

16:25.670 --> 16:27.090
What kind of spells can you cast?

16:27.090 --> 16:29.050
<i>Everyone always gets carried away.</i>

16:29.130 --> 16:30.260
I can do anything!

16:30.260 --> 16:31.550
<i>You're getting carried away, too!</i>

16:32.130 --> 16:38.180
WHOAAAA!!!

16:32.930 --> 16:34.840
Nico, don't get too carried away, okay?

16:34.840 --> 16:36.050
What do you want to see?

16:36.050 --> 16:39.100
I would recommend a spell
that shifts gravity sideways.

16:39.100 --> 16:40.350
That sounds amazing!

16:40.350 --> 16:41.680
Let's do that one!

16:41.890 --> 16:47.440
<i>Dang it, being in a new environment
has her need for approval skyrocketing.</i>

16:42.310 --> 16:45.060
Liberty gravity!

16:49.230 --> 16:51.030
Good morning.

16:52.950 --> 16:54.910
<i>Did I enter the Infinity Castle?</i>

16:56.320 --> 17:00.870
Okay, so I thought Nakime
had kidnapped me, but I guess not.

17:00.870 --> 17:03.250
No more playing around, okay?

17:03.250 --> 17:04.750
Yes, ma'am.

17:04.750 --> 17:10.590
Classes will begin starting today,
but our first period is recreation.

17:08.460 --> 17:10.590
CLASS FRIENDSHIP
RECREATION

17:10.920 --> 17:13.170
The class has the freedom
to decide what to do.

17:13.170 --> 17:17.090
By the way, back when I was
a student, we did Fruits Basket.

17:17.090 --> 17:18.050
So childish.

17:18.050 --> 17:20.890
How're we supposed to play
Fruits Basket as high school kids?

17:20.890 --> 17:24.600
I mean, we have Nico in our class,

17:24.810 --> 17:26.730
so we have to play around
with her magic, right?

17:28.270 --> 17:29.320
Magic is so cool!

17:29.320 --> 17:30.480
I want to fly!

17:30.480 --> 17:31.730
Like the Air Dance Technique!

17:31.900 --> 17:35.990
No way! Do not use magic for fun!

17:36.740 --> 17:40.410
This is a barrier we witches use
when we practice our flying.

17:40.410 --> 17:42.370
When you're inside it, you can fly!

17:42.540 --> 17:44.370
That's a crazy thing to say
like it's nothing.

17:44.370 --> 17:46.120
- Awesome!
- She's a witch after all.

17:46.120 --> 17:49.130
- So we can fly!
- I'm so exited!

17:46.540 --> 17:49.130
<i>She's not listening to a word I say.</i>

17:49.340 --> 17:54.590
When you want to move forward,
you just think in your heart, "Forward!"

17:54.840 --> 18:00.180
If you want to turn right,
then think, "Right!"

17:56.550 --> 18:00.970
ENA URUSE

17:56.840 --> 18:00.510
I guess you have to lighten up when you fly.

18:00.180 --> 18:03.350
And for left, just think, "Left!"

18:00.930 --> 18:02.260
<i>Is this gonna be okay?</i>

18:03.720 --> 18:06.850
So yeah. Let's get started!

18:10.110 --> 18:12.650
Oh wow! I'm actually flying!

18:12.730 --> 18:16.740
<i>In situations like this, everyone's
individual personalities really shine through.</i>

18:16.990 --> 18:20.490
KOMUGI KUROWA

18:16.990 --> 18:20.490
KUKUMI URESHINO

18:16.990 --> 18:20.490
SUZUKA KIYOMIYA

18:17.360 --> 18:20.490
<i>There are those who take it
for a careful test run.</i>

18:21.120 --> 18:24.620
<i>Those who challenge it with all their might
in order to learn by doing.</i>

18:21.160 --> 18:21.830
TSUYOSHI ISHI

18:22.030 --> 18:22.490
YUKI ARISUGI

18:23.080 --> 18:23.540
YUKI ARISUGI

18:23.740 --> 18:24.080
TSUYOSHI ISHI

18:24.870 --> 18:28.750
TAKASHI ISSHIKI

18:24.870 --> 18:28.750
RIN FUWA

18:25.290 --> 18:28.750
<i>Some will find a nice balance
and kick back to relax.</i>

18:29.460 --> 18:31.130
<i>Some guys will begin to maneuver</i>

18:31.090 --> 18:33.460
KOITERU CHOUSHI

18:31.090 --> 18:33.460
RIKIHARU HARIKI

18:31.130 --> 18:33.460
<i>in an acrobatic manner where the girls
can definitely see them.</i>

18:34.000 --> 18:37.340
<i>Some will get the hang of it quickly, and
then pretend to be Dragon Ball characters.</i>

18:34.420 --> 18:35.090
RYUTA SHIPPOU

18:35.090 --> 18:35.510
TSUYOSHI ISHI

18:36.550 --> 18:37.090
KARA MINAMI

18:38.340 --> 18:41.470
<i>The otaku who also secretly wants
to pretend to be a Dragon Ball character.</i>

18:38.590 --> 18:41.470
HOMEROOM TEACHER
YURI MAKUWA

18:41.720 --> 18:48.350
KEIGO MAGAMI

18:41.970 --> 18:45.640
<i>Then there's the hipster poser
who's too cool for this stuff</i>

18:45.640 --> 18:48.390
<i>because he has better hobbies
that let him soar to higher heights.</i>

18:48.600 --> 18:51.730
ARASHI KOMERAN

18:48.770 --> 18:51.730
<i>And we can't forget the contrarian who even
refuses to change into gym clothes.</i>

18:52.020 --> 18:55.280
<i>And so, after all that,
they all got along swimmingly.</i>

18:55.280 --> 18:57.110
This class is super easy-going, huh?!

18:57.110 --> 18:58.360
GRADE 1 CLASS 2

18:57.530 --> 18:59.910
Excuse me, Class 3 is flying.

18:59.910 --> 19:01.160
That looks awesome.

19:01.160 --> 19:03.240
There's a witch in Class 3.

19:03.450 --> 19:06.000
And here we are doing Fruits Basket.

19:09.750 --> 19:11.250
Are you okay, Nico?

19:11.540 --> 19:13.920
You must be expending
a lot of magic power.

19:14.040 --> 19:16.260
I am, but I'll be fine.

19:16.460 --> 19:18.590
Magic power can be replenished
if I eat red bean paste!

19:18.590 --> 19:19.630
Really?!

19:20.760 --> 19:23.260
I'm glad everyone's having fun.

19:24.350 --> 19:29.100
I just happened to be born as a witch,
and I can do things like fly.

19:29.690 --> 19:32.770
I thought it was unfair
that others couldn't.

19:33.520 --> 19:35.860
But I'm happy I got to share this
with everyone.

19:36.980 --> 19:39.200
So that's how you've been looking at it.

19:40.070 --> 19:44.370
I've never had a fun moment
from being born as an ogre.

19:45.990 --> 19:48.660
Your powers are so amazing, though.

19:48.660 --> 19:51.460
You should tell everyone
that you're an ogre.

19:55.500 --> 19:58.300
My mom said I can't play with you anymore.

19:58.840 --> 20:02.220
Because you're not normal.

20:08.520 --> 20:10.560
Then no one would ever get near me.

20:13.560 --> 20:14.770
Excuse me.

20:15.480 --> 20:18.070
Can you park that
on the edge of the track field?

20:18.070 --> 20:18.980
Sure thing.

20:22.820 --> 20:24.280
The truck's gonna enter the barrier!

20:30.330 --> 20:31.790
What?

20:33.920 --> 20:34.790
Watch out!

20:34.790 --> 20:35.710
It's gonna fall!

20:50.640 --> 20:51.730
Are you all right?

20:51.730 --> 20:53.190
Yeah but, are you?

20:53.350 --> 20:55.730
Hey, what was that just now?

20:55.810 --> 20:58.480
That was impressive. I thought you died.

20:58.480 --> 20:59.940
How did you do that?

21:00.570 --> 21:02.490
That was actually my...

21:06.120 --> 21:07.320
I'm actually...

21:08.330 --> 21:09.370
an ogre.

21:10.870 --> 21:14.370
I look like a human, but I'm not normal.

21:16.040 --> 21:17.920
So, please don't...

21:17.920 --> 21:19.840
You're amazing!

21:20.500 --> 21:23.130
- An ogre?
- Seriously, that's so cool.

21:24.050 --> 21:26.970
You guys aren't scared?
Wait, you believe me?

21:27.550 --> 21:29.760
I mean, we have a witch here, so...

21:29.760 --> 21:32.310
Dude, we were all flying just now.

21:32.310 --> 21:35.600
We won't be shocked to hear that
the witch's childhood friend is an ogre.

21:36.060 --> 21:39.110
<i>Class 3, no thoughts, head empty, huh?</i>

21:44.450 --> 21:47.070
<i>Well if they're cool with it,
then that's okay.</i>

21:48.030 --> 21:51.370
<i>And so, with the continuous reveals,</i>

21:51.370 --> 21:53.870
<i>it was discovered that a witch
and an ogre had enrolled in their school.</i>

21:54.370 --> 21:57.370
<i>Class 1-3 had become
rather fairy tale-esque,</i>

21:57.960 --> 22:00.880
<i>but their reactions were rather positive.</i>

22:01.050 --> 22:05.130
<i>Everyone wanted to get along
without causing too much of a commotion,</i>

22:05.720 --> 22:07.800
<i>so we're nonetheless thankful
for our classmates.</i>

22:08.680 --> 22:09.680
<i>However...</i>

22:10.010 --> 22:15.310
Otogi, can you ask Nico if she has a spell
that can switch my left and right eyes?

22:15.310 --> 22:19.650
Oh! And is carrying something like this
totally easy with your ogre strength?

22:20.060 --> 22:24.530
<i>I still somehow attract the weird ones.</i>

23:57.580 --> 24:03.380
<i>I made so many friends.</i>

24:03.380 --> 24:04.250
What song is that?

24:04.250 --> 24:05.880
You don't know "Many Friends Samba"?

24:05.880 --> 24:07.510
How would I? Who sung it?

24:07.510 --> 24:10.840
I'm adlibbing Rina Kawaguchi.
I'll sing it again. "I made so many..."

24:08.010 --> 24:11.970
NEXT EPISODE
FRESH TRANSPARENT
FASHIONS FOR SPRING
WITCH'S DELIVERY SERVICE
LOST DOGS AND
THE PATTER OF RAIN

24:10.840 --> 24:11.970
She's good!
